idle: only real input wakes monitors

An idle inhibitor appearing (Firefox "Playing audio", any ScreenSaver.Inhibit)
makes the compositor send `resumed` to every notification that respects
inhibitors. IdleService took that for the user coming back and powered the
monitors on with nobody there; niri already wakes on real input by itself.

- monitorOffMonitor no longer requests power-on
- postLockMonitorOffMonitor ignores inhibitors: a locked screen goes dark
  whatever is playing behind it
- lockWakeMonitor runs whenever DMS powered the monitors off (upstream
  22fa08f0f + 14de920cd) and is the only path that clears monitorsOff

Applied to the installed tree in postInstall: `src` is `./core`, so `patches`
never reaches the QML. Drop the lockWakeMonitor hunks on a bump past 14de920cd
(upstream renames it to wakeMonitor).

